<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Daisy's Personal Page</title>
    <!-- Links your CSS stylesheet -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
    </header>

    <main>
      
        <section id="about">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>Hey!!! My name is Daisy, I'm 21 and I love listening to music (mostly rock, post-hardcore, and indie/bedroom pop). I also love to watch horror movies and go to concerts as often as I can.</p>
        </section>

       
        <section id="gallery">
            <h2>My Favorite Photos</h2>
            <div class="image-container">
                <img src="picture1.jpg" alt="Description of picture 1">
                <img src="picture2.jpg" alt="Description of picture 2">
                <img src="picture3.jpg" alt="Description of picture 3">
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My COMP 150 Project - Daisy Quijano</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>

body {
    background-color: #7fc1fa; 
    color: #1f2429;         
    font-family: 'Georgia', Verdana; 
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
}

h1 {
    color: ##112866; 
    font-size: 2.5rem;
}

h2 {
    color: ##040e29; /* ➔ CHANGE THIS: Pick a color for your section headers */
    border-bottom: 2px solid #4b6b94;
    display: inline-block;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
}

/* Requirement 3: Creative styling for your 3 pictures */
img {
    width: 250px; 
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 0px; 
    margin: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}
